{"version":1,"key":"card:415","content":{"id":415,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"隐写术是指将一个文件隐藏在另一个文件中，一个最常见的例子就是藏头诗，把信息藏在诗的开头，或者诗的其它位置。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9f81578b-4bb6-44c1-97e5-27c86e24aee1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"在计算机中，可以使用图片来传递隐藏的文件信息。对于一副图片，每个像素有 rgb 三个通道，每个通道使用一个字节表示，如果使用图片 rgb 每个通道的最后一个比特来传递信息，由于最后一个比特对整幅图片的影响不大，人眼几乎无法分别，可以做到在不影响原图的情况下隐藏另一个文件。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d355c9ba-2f51-4551-8ab8-c93d573f6e6b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"对于大小为 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"w \\cdot h","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2b52b448-c43b-48e0-8588-8291adbe5c22","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"w \\cdot h","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"﻿ 的图片，其包含 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"w \\cdot h \\cdot 3","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"80a19f39-b390-47f2-baec-42c4d624d0f6","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"w \\cdot h \\cdot 3","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"﻿ 个字节，可以传递 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"w \\cdot h \\cdot 3","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f51fd590-f25a-43ea-b5ad-1a762a9bbda7","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"w \\cdot h \\cdot 3","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"﻿ 个比特的信息，假设图片的大小为 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"1024 \\dcot 720","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ba534400-726f-4e7c-9d73-dfd9dda8f242","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1024 \\cdot 720","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"，那么可以传递 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"2211840 bit","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"20facf80-9a73-4492-9788-7cb8c7aea198","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893a